{"2153760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stronghold 4", "steam_appid": 2153760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/fcc9260f54fd409c15e98d5778771d02.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/fcc9260f54fd409c15e98d5778771d02.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of a living medieval world on your castle economy and siegecraft, as you battle against hostile outlaws, rival lords and the elements themselves in this new narrative RTS set years before the events of the original Stronghold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronghold 4</strong> is the long-awaited next mainline entry in the Stronghold 'castle sim' series, bringing a cinematic story and medieval immersion to the forefront of real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/719c0f6bbf15196786ca37d8cd63c85c.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/719c0f6bbf15196786ca37d8cd63c85c.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaiming the series' roots of medieval England, this latest game marks a return to the simulation of intricate castle life, realism and atmosphere that started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/a6b2be106b34b93a756a989375e529e6.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/a6b2be106b34b93a756a989375e529e6.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the tale of Penryn of Wethel as his simple shepherd’s life is upended and he is forced through trial by fire to become the leader he sees within himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out Penryn's destiny alongside a cast of new and returning characters, as you manifest this humble peasant's potential and lead his forces in search of glory and knighthood. Starring inspired performances by Ben Starr, Samantha Béart, Walles Hamonde and Harry McEntire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/952c4772dfea8d50bfd946a1816e4b5b.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/952c4772dfea8d50bfd946a1816e4b5b.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/6d5d18ade804f9ea1d896fd7f4659c65.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/6d5d18ade804f9ea1d896fd7f4659c65.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/6d5d18ade804f9ea1d896fd7f4659c65.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the cutting-edge visuals and gritty reality of medieval England, from snow hindering crop growth and heavy rain reducing archery range, to deadly castle traps and constructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/8eb67ad8413c8aa2c03fc1de0f49ee7e.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/8eb67ad8413c8aa2c03fc1de0f49ee7e.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/53d4ae1a5d85acf984d8ff245b54091b.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/53d4ae1a5d85acf984d8ff245b54091b.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/53d4ae1a5d85acf984d8ff245b54091b.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this plays out across larger-than-ever maps, with the bloody sieges and grand warfare of Stronghold feeling more epic than ever before! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/f5519c08769049fdf7b92a81cb889894.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/f5519c08769049fdf7b92a81cb889894.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE ORIGINS</strong> of Stronghold and live the tale of Penryn of Wethel, in this narrative prequel with new music from Robert L. Euvino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASCEND TO GREATNESS </strong>in a cinematic 22-mission campaign, featuring original larger-than-life characters alongside familiar favourites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR CASTLE</strong> with cosmetics and feudal details. Balance honour, taxes, food and more to keep peace amongst the peasantry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARPEN YOUR SIEGECRAFT </strong>with unique tactical military structures and units as well as popular classics like moats and tunnelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER THE BATTLEFRONT </strong>using enhanced medieval war mechanics, forcing you to consider weather, army composition and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARCH WITHOUT FEAR</strong> into a fully-featured skirmish mode with 8 fearsome CPU opponents at launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR OWN LEGEND </strong>through additional solo modes and content including a full skirmish trail, free build and custom skirmish modes.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/fcc9260f54fd409c15e98d5778771d02.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/fcc9260f54fd409c15e98d5778771d02.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/91a4afdbcfa46dcc632d3a5a48f1bdf2.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the impact of a living medieval world on your castle economy and siegecraft, as you battle against hostile outlaws, rival lords and the elements themselves in this new narrative RTS set years before the events of the original Stronghold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronghold 4</strong> is the long-awaited next mainline entry in the Stronghold 'castle sim' series, bringing a cinematic story and medieval immersion to the forefront of real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/719c0f6bbf15196786ca37d8cd63c85c.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/719c0f6bbf15196786ca37d8cd63c85c.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/3f3ce712f328848eead6a68a27cd9157.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaiming the series' roots of medieval England, this latest game marks a return to the simulation of intricate castle life, realism and atmosphere that started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/a6b2be106b34b93a756a989375e529e6.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/a6b2be106b34b93a756a989375e529e6.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.poster.avif?t=1785852165\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.webm?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/b7a087c07d1837a732b11ec0bd191240.mp4?t=1785852165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the tale of Penryn of Wethel as his simple shepherd’s life is upended and he is forced through trial by fire to become the leader he sees within himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out Penryn's destiny alongside a cast of new and returning characters, as you manifest this humble peasant's potential and lead his forces in search of glory and knighthood. Starring inspired performances by Ben Starr, Samantha Béart, Walles Hamonde and Harry McEntire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/952c4772dfea8d50bfd946a1816e4b5b.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/952c4772dfea8d50bfd946a1816e4b5b.webp?t=1785852165 wi