"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this plays out across larger-than-ever maps, with the bloody sieges and grand warfare of Stronghold feeling more epic than ever before! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras/f5519c08769049fdf7b92a81cb889894.avif?t=1785852165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/extras_big/f5519c08769049fdf7b92a81cb889894.webp?t=1785852165 width=1560 height=282 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE ORIGINS</strong> of Stronghold and live the tale of Penryn of Wethel, in this narrative prequel with new music from Robert L. Euvino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASCEND TO GREATNESS </strong>in a cinematic 22-mission campaign, featuring original larger-than-life characters alongside familiar favourites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR CASTLE</strong> with cosmetics and feudal details. Balance honour, taxes, food and more to keep peace amongst the peasantry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARPEN YOUR SIEGECRAFT </strong>with unique tactical military structures and units as well as popular classics like moats and tunnelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER THE BATTLEFRONT </strong>using enhanced medieval war mechanics, forcing you to consider weather, army composition and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARCH WITHOUT FEAR</strong> into a fully-featured skirmish mode with 8 fearsome CPU opponents at launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR OWN LEGEND </strong>through additional solo modes and content including a full skirmish trail, free build and custom skirmish modes.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Wood needed! Return to the green roots of Stronghold in this narrative prequel to the original 'castle sim'. Immerse yourself in a cinematic campaign, hone your siegecraft with new mechanics in skirmish mode and customise your castles with a wide selection of castle pieces and cosmetics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Stronghold 4 is the best thing that has happened to the strategy series in over 20 years.”<br />\r\nGameStar<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Stronghold is back in earnest, with Ben Starr taking up the mantle to boot. What a time to be a Stronghold fan.”<br />\r\nFinger Guns<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“I played the first Stronghold at school on my father's laptop. Today, I can present the fourth one to you. Feels a bit surreal, all of it.”<br />\r\nMaurice Webber<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/c10b801e40c8e04cd8a46f363639837b4921eeb2/header.jpg?t=1785852165", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/e0c2ebf072ac7af2b0f19ce9c887530580835e5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785852165", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153760/e0c2ebf072ac7af2b0f19ce9c887530580835e5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785852165", "website": "https://www.stronghold4.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-4670 or AMD equiva